                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e4d12e3c-dc31-3dac-9e88-e8d944a155b6",
                                        "entry_id": "ec12aafe-c327-3b0f-9451-8281873fd02a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A difference in ages between two or more people, especially in the context of romantic or sexual relationships."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f0d581c-ed2b-4972-898b-1d061ef5d189",
                                                "sense_id": "e4d12e3c-dc31-3dac-9e88-e8d944a155b6",
                                                "text": "There's always an arranged marriage. I can attest to their efficacy – though perhaps you should try an age gap less chasmous than Cesco's. Or mine! Also, it seems to me that if a woman wooed you, you could marry her."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe27727c-0685-4b01-bf5a-405154071cbc",
                                                "sense_id": "e4d12e3c-dc31-3dac-9e88-e8d944a155b6",
                                                "text": "In the same episode, 39-year-old Matt Smith’s character of Daemon Targaryen takes part in an incest scene with his niece Rhaenyra, played by 22-year-old actor Milly Alcock – an age gap of 17 years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bceb7d89-7e8f-4886-991e-4b619b069bb9",
                                                "sense_id": "e4d12e3c-dc31-3dac-9e88-e8d944a155b6",
                                                "text": "A new study published in Personal Relationships provides insight into how the age gap between romantic partners changes when people enter relationships at different life stages."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a57e5467-34d4-402f-b00d-831a16ddac09",
                                                "sense_id": "e4d12e3c-dc31-3dac-9e88-e8d944a155b6",
                                                "text": "Benji and Ava have overcome the age gap and discovered exciting ways to develop their sex life[.]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "17b577d4-c14a-45e5-816d-d8d2db4144f6",
                        "source_entry_id": "3c506f7a-3eb0-34f4-a925-399285f99e10",
                        "source_sense_id": "82c0fe92-3242-35d6-8497-312a6ecea30c",
                        "source_sense_description": "de ongelijkheid van de leeftijd; onderscheid in leeftijd",
                        "target_lang_word": "age difference",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "age difference",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75f35265-1e3b-34c7-9f7f-fd768f68c74e",
                                        "entry_id": "71819b40-0fff-376f-a656-3790cd452975",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A difference in ages between two or more people."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d0a446d-cfd9-444e-b861-96ee7607a246",
                                                "sense_id": "75f35265-1e3b-34c7-9f7f-fd768f68c74e",
                                                "text": "I suppose the reason so many Snapefic writers pair him up with Hermione is that she's really the only choice unless you're going to introduce an original character. In the long run, I don't see the age difference being a problem because of how long wizards live. In the short run, yeah, I could see Snape getting frustrated rather often with being the only adult in the relationship."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88eeb671-b1c0-4f52-b4fc-7fc7dc3da030",
                                                "sense_id": "75f35265-1e3b-34c7-9f7f-fd768f68c74e",
                                                "text": "One study found second-borns to be lower in self-esteem than firstborns or last-borns, particularly if the age difference between them and the other siblings was approximately 2 years"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05e6c7a6-3a6a-4771-a6d7-b9e4dbd43b4a",
                                                "sense_id": "75f35265-1e3b-34c7-9f7f-fd768f68c74e",
                                                "text": "I understand that once she has found a regular relationship, no matter the age difference, ,^([sic]) she's no longer a cougar. I'm not sure if a regular booty-call partner is enough of a relationship to break her cougarness. However, the best definition, I believe, is a cougar (as any wild cat) is on the prowl for fresh (young) meat!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
